          <groundspeak:finder id="985002">Strider&#39;s Ride</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP576 Eaton Road&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prior to stopping here at the cap, we had spent a bit of time wandering around on the Beaver Boardwalk located here in town. 

There were no troubles finding this one with the large depression in the ground, and after a few minutes spent scooping out dirt and debris, the photos were taken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TFTCap ofth!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
